# Trivy ignore file for the devsecops-demo image.
#
# Policy: an entry is allowed only with
#   1. the CVE ID,
#   2. a one line reason why it does not affect this image, and
#   3. an expiry date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD) so it is reviewed again.
# After the expiry date Trivy reports the CVE again and the gate blocks.
#
# The pipeline already uses --ignore-unfixed, so CVEs without an upstream fix
# never need to be listed here.
#
# Format example (not active):
# CVE-2025-8869 exp:2026-12-31
#   reason: pip tar extraction issue; pip is only used at build time in the
#   builder stage and never installs untrusted sdists in the running container.
#
# Active entries: none
